# oops.brs opens a file that does not exist after the first key.
expect "OOPS TEST"
press ENTER
# the error is the point of this test, so it is accounted for
expect error 4152
# the program now waits at the error prompt; CLEAR PROC stops it and its
# procedure, SYSTEM ends BR (SYSTEM alone is refused with 2108, program is active)
type CLEAR PROC
press ENTER
type SYSTEM
press ENTER
wait end
